+// right?" - the item's own question, then four answers A to D, one right and three of the skill
+// provider's wrong answers (its named misconceptions). The pupil ticks one box. It is the Check
+// Question of every detailed lesson as a pupil item (the shared `whichRight` option,
+// js/modules/which-right.js, applies it to any skill on every host).
+//
+// payload: {stem: [lines], choices: [4 strings], correct: index}
